      "title": "dumpcap: Eliminate a Mac OS X 10.6.x workaround.",
      "message": "dumpcap: Eliminate a Mac OS X 10.6.x workaround.\n\nThis workaround for a defect in pcap_open_live in earlier Mac OS X 10.6 patch\nreleases (prior to 10.6.5) has been unnecessary since we dropped support for\nMac OS X 10.6 in Wireshark 3.0.  Zap it.\n\n\n(cherry picked from commit e6177fcbeddebe9d280699580eb9a1de713bcec8)\n\nCo-authored-by: Darius Davis <darius-wireshark@free-range.com.au>",
